{"title":"Career Roadmap · Compliance Executive","role":"Compliance Executive","summary":"A Compliance Executive helps an organisation follow applicable laws, regulations, internal policies, contractual requirements, and corporate governance procedures. The role involves maintaining statutory records, tracking deadlines, preparing documentation, supporting audits, monitoring regulatory changes, and coordinating with legal, finance, HR, and business teams.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Corporate Secretaryship"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Corporate Secretaryship","Compliance Internship","Compliance Executive","Senior Compliance Executive","Compliance Officer / Assistant Company Secretary","Compliance Manager","Head of Compliance / Company Secretary"]},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“Compliance Executive” is a broad role. In India, company-secretarial and certain regulated compliance responsibilities have specific qualification and professional requirements. A B.Com graduate can enter support/executive-level compliance roles, but higher-level statutory company-secretarial work may require the relevant professional qualification."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Industry Direction","What to Build"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Digitised compliance operations"},{"text":"Corporate law basics, documentation, Excel, statutory calendars"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Automated compliance monitoring"},{"text":"ERP, workflow tools, Power Query, compliance tracking"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Data-driven compliance"},{"text":"SQL, Power BI, risk dashboards"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"RegTech adoption"},{"text":"RPA, automated controls, regulatory technology"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Continuous compliance"},{"text":"Real-time monitoring and automated evidence collection"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-assisted governance"},{"text":"AI regulatory research, risk detection, automated compliance workflows"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business & corporate-law foundation"},{"text":"Company basics, documentation, Excel"},{"text":"Mock statutory-record project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Compliance operations"},{"text":"MCA concepts, ROC filings, registers, calendars"},{"text":"Compliance tracker"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Governance & risk"},{"text":"Secretarial practices, internal controls, Power BI"},{"text":"Compliance dashboard"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional readiness"},{"text":"Regulatory research, audit support, automation"},{"text":"Compliance internship + case project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Corporate & Legal Foundations"},{"type":"h","text":"Business Law Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Contract fundamentals"},{"text":"Company concepts"},{"text":"Corporate structures"},{"text":"Partnership concepts"},{"text":"LLP fundamentals"},{"text":"Basic commercial law"},{"text":"Corporate governance concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Regulation","Internal policy","Procedure","Evidence"]},{"type":"h","text":"Company Fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Private company"},{"text":"Public company"},{"text":"One Person Company"},{"text":"LLP"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Board of Directors"},{"text":"General meetings"},{"text":"Share capital"},{"text":"Corporate records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the basic corporate structure:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Shareholders","Board","Management","Operations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation Skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Compliance work is heavily documentation-oriented."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional email writing"},{"text":"Meeting minutes"},{"text":"Notices"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Checklists"},{"text":"Registers"},{"text":"Filing records"},{"text":"Document version control"},{"text":"Evidence management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to maintain a clear:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Requirement","Action","Evidence","Approval","Filing","Due date"]},{"type":"p","text":"audit trail."},{"type":"h","text":"Excel"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sorting/filtering"},{"text":"Tables"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"COUNTIFS"},{"text":"Pivot Tables"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel to build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Statutory trackers"},{"text":"Entity registers"},{"text":"Contract trackers"},{"text":"Audit issue trackers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Compliance Operations"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop working knowledge of areas such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board meetings"},{"text":"General meetings"},{"text":"Notices"},{"text":"Agendas"},{"text":"Minutes"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Director records"},{"text":"Shareholder records"},{"text":"Statutory registers"},{"text":"Annual filings"},{"text":"Event-based filings"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For Indian corporate work, learn the relevant requirements under the Companies Act and applicable rules, while checking current requirements before acting on them."},{"type":"h","text":"MCA / ROC Processes"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Ministry of Corporate Affairs systems"},{"text":"Registrar of Companies"},{"text":"Corporate filings"},{"text":"Director-related filings"},{"text":"Company master data"},{"text":"Statutory forms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not memorise form numbers as a substitute for understanding the underlying compliance requirement; forms and procedures can change."},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Calendar"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a system tracking:"},{"type":"table","header":["Field","Example"],"rows":[[{"text":"Requirement"},{"text":"Annual filing"}],[{"text":"Applicable Entity"},{"text":"Company"}],[{"text":"Due Date"},{"text":"Specific statutory deadline"}],[{"text":"Responsible Person"},{"text":"Compliance team"}],[{"text":"Documents"},{"text":"Required evidence"}],[{"text":"Status"},{"text":"Pending/Completed"}],[{"text":"Reviewer"},{"text":"Manager/CS"}],[{"text":"Filing Reference"},{"text":"Evidence"}],[{"text":"Escalation"},{"text":"If overdue"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The ability to never miss a deadline is a core operational skill."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Governance, Risk & Controls"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board responsibilities"},{"text":"Director duties"},{"text":"Conflict-of-interest concepts"},{"text":"Related-party transactions"},{"text":"Disclosure requirements"},{"text":"Shareholder rights"},{"text":"Board committees"},{"text":"Corporate records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Governance","Controls","Monitoring","Reporting"]},{"type":"h","text":"Internal Controls"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Segregation of duties"},{"text":"Approval controls"},{"text":"Access controls"},{"text":"Reconciliations"},{"text":"Exception reporting"},{"text":"Evidence retention"},{"text":"Periodic reviews"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Employee creates transaction","Manager approves","Finance processes","System records","Compliance reviews"]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a professional research process:"},{"type":"h","text":"Question"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify applicable law/regulation"},{"type":"h","text":"Find current primary source"},{"type":"h","text":"Determine applicability"},{"type":"h","text":"Document interpretation"},{"type":"h","text":"Identify action"},{"type":"h","text":"Record evidence"},{"type":"p","text":"This is much safer than relying on outdated summaries."},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Support"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Internal audits"},{"text":"Statutory audits"},{"text":"Compliance audits"},{"text":"Regulatory inspections"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Documents"},{"text":"Registers"},{"text":"Policies"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Reconciliations"},{"text":"Management responses"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to track:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Finding","Root cause","Corrective action","Owner","Deadline","Closure evidence"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Compliance Technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"Build dashboards for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Open compliance items"},{"text":"Overdue filings"},{"text":"Department-wise compliance"},{"text":"Risk level"},{"text":"Audit findings"},{"text":"Corrective actions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance Database","Power BI","Risk Dashboard"]},{"type":"h","text":"SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"JOIN"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"Aggregations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"SQL becomes useful when compliance data comes from:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"HR systems"},{"text":"Finance systems"},{"text":"Vendor systems"},{"text":"Contract databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Automation"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power Automate"},{"text":"RPA"},{"text":"Workflow automation"},{"text":"Automated reminders"},{"text":"Document workflows"},{"text":"Approval workflows"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance due date","Automated reminder","Owner confirmation","Evidence upload","Reviewer approval","Closure"]},{"type":"h","text":"RegTech"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand how technology can support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Risk scoring"},{"text":"Evidence management"},{"text":"Policy management"},{"text":"Audit trails"},{"text":"Automated controls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation Options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Additional Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Corporate Compliance"},{"text":"Companies Act, governance"}],[{"text":"Secretarial Compliance"},{"text":"Board/meeting/filing processes"}],[{"text":"Regulatory Compliance"},{"text":"Industry regulations"}],[{"text":"Banking Compliance"},{"text":"Banking regulations, KYC/AML"}],[{"text":"Financial Compliance"},{"text":"Finance controls, reporting"}],[{"text":"Tax Compliance"},{"text":"GST, TDS, tax processes"}],[{"text":"Labour Compliance"},{"text":"Employment regulations"}],[{"text":"Data Compliance"},{"text":"Privacy, information governance"}],[{"text":"Contract Compliance"},{"text":"Contract obligations"}],[{"text":"ESG Compliance"},{"text":"Sustainability disclosures"}],[{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Automation, data and compliance technology"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company secretarial firms"},{"text":"CA/CS firms"},{"text":"Corporate legal departments"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"NBFCs"},{"text":"Insurance companies"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Compliance service providers"},{"text":"FinTech companies"},{"text":"Corporate governance teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Company Secretary Intern"},{"text":"Corporate Governance Intern"},{"text":"Legal & Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Secretarial Intern"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Regulatory Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Audit & Compliance Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An internship with a Practising Company Secretary or corporate secretarial/compliance team can provide particularly relevant exposure."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong Internship Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Compliance Management System"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a realistic compliance-management workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"Step 1 — Entity Profile"},{"type":"p","text":"Maintain:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Entity type"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Registered information"},{"text":"Applicable regulations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 2 — Compliance Register"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Requirement"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Due date"},{"text":"Responsible person"},{"text":"Evidence"},{"text":"Status"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 3 — Risk Classification"},{"type":"p","text":"Classify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Low"},{"text":"Medium"},{"text":"High"}]},{"type":"p","text":"based on factors such as deadline sensitivity and business impact."},{"type":"h","text":"Step 4 — Audit Tracker"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Finding","Owner","Action","Due date","Evidence","Closure"]},{"type":"h","text":"Step 5 — Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Open items"},{"text":"Overdue items"},{"text":"Upcoming deadlines"},{"text":"Risk levels"},{"text":"Audit findings"},{"text":"Department performance"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["This demonstrates compliance knowledge","operational discipline","technology skills."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Professional Qualifications","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Core"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate law"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Compliance management"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Audit fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Company Secretary Path"},{"type":"p","text":"For a student specifically targeting company-secretarial and corporate-governance careers, the Company Secretary (CS) qualification is a major professional pathway in India."},{"type":"p","text":"The relevant professional body is the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI)."},{"type":"p","text":"The student should verify the current ICSI eligibility, examination structure, training requirements and applicable exemptions before planning the route."},{"type":"h","text":"Other Useful Areas"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on specialisation:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Internal audit"},{"text":"AML/KYC"},{"text":"Data privacy"},{"text":"Information security"},{"text":"ESG compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not treat short-term certificates as substitutes for regulated professional qualifications where a specific qualification is legally required."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Entry-Level"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance Executive"},{"text":"Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Secretarial Executive"},{"text":"Corporate Governance Executive"},{"text":"Legal & Compliance Executive"},{"text":"Regulatory Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Risk & Compliance Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"With Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Senior Compliance Executive"},{"text":"Compliance Officer"},{"text":"Secretarial Officer"},{"text":"Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Regulatory Compliance Specialist"},{"text":"Corporate Governance Specialist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Leadership"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance Manager"},{"text":"Secretarial Manager"},{"text":"Head of Compliance"},{"text":"Chief Compliance Officer"},{"text":"Company Secretary"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility for senior regulated roles depends on the organisation and applicable law/professional qualification."},{"type":"h","text":"Interview Questions"},{"type":"p","text":"Expect questions such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is corporate compliance?"},{"text":"Why is compliance important?"},{"text":"What is corporate governance?"},{"text":"What is the role of a Board of Directors?"},{"text":"What is a statutory register?"},{"text":"What is a compliance calendar?"},{"text":"How would you prevent a compliance deadline from being missed?"},{"text":"What is an internal control?"},{"text":"What is segregation of duties?"},{"text":"What is an audit trail?"},{"text":"How would you respond to an audit finding?"},{"text":"How do you research a regulatory requirement?"},{"text":"What is the difference between a policy and a procedure?"},{"text":"How would you maintain confidential corporate documents?"},{"text":"How can compliance activities be automated?"},{"text":"What is regulatory risk?"},{"text":"How would you prioritise multiple compliance deadlines?"},{"text":"Explain a compliance project you completed."}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"M.Com"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Commerce"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Corporate law fundamentals"},{"text":"Finance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"MBA"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant specialisations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Finance"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Qualification"},{"type":"p","text":"For a dedicated corporate-secretarial career:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","CS qualification","Secretarial/Compliance career"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is generally a stronger pathway than relying solely on a generic postgraduate degree for senior company-secretarial responsibilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Government / Public-Sector Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Relevant areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public-sector company compliance"},{"text":"Government corporations"},{"text":"Regulatory organisations"},{"text":"Public-sector banks"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"Government administration"},{"text":"Corporate governance functions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles vary by recruitment process."},{"type":"p","text":"For regulated/legal/company-secretarial positions, check the specific notification and qualification requirements."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant master's fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate Governance"},{"text":"Corporate Law"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Risk Management"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Financial Regulation"},{"text":"International Business"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Ireland"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For international compliance careers, add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory frameworks"},{"text":"AML/KYC"},{"text":"Data privacy"},{"text":"Financial regulation"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Risk management"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"0–2 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Executive"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance tracking"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Filing support"},{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Audit support"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Compliance Executive / Compliance Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance ownership"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Internal controls"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance Officer / Compliance Manager"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compliance programmes"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Audit"},{"text":"Regulatory relationships"},{"text":"Team management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"8–12 Years"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Compliance Manager / Head of Compliance"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Enterprise compliance"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Regulatory strategy"},{"text":"Risk"}]},{"type":"h","text":"12+ Years"},{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chief Compliance Officer"},{"text":"Head of Compliance"},{"text":"Company Secretary"},{"text":"Governance Director"},{"text":"Compliance Consultant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Company Secretary Route"},{"type":"p","text":"For students specifically interested in corporate governance:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","CS qualification","Secretarial Executive","Assistant Company Secretary","Company Secretary / Compliance Head"]},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Companies Act"},{"text":"Secretarial standards"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Board processes"},{"text":"Regulatory filings"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Governance advisory"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk & Compliance Route"},{"type":"p","text":"Another pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance Executive","Risk & Compliance Analyst","Senior Analyst","Compliance Manager","Chief Compliance Officer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Risk frameworks"},{"text":"Internal controls"},{"text":"Audit"},{"text":"AML/KYC"},{"text":"Data analytics"},{"text":"Regulatory technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI + Compliance Route"},{"type":"p","text":"A future-focused profile combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Co